; Stage 15 W4a / findings §3.5: a same-file forward reference to a `defvar`.
; Whether this resolves was left to W1; W4a's contract was only that the failure
; carry a real location (enforced by the run_no_line_zero sweep).
;
; It now RESOLVES: Stage 15 W8 G-0 (design/global-init.md §5) registers value
; names on the whole-graph prescan, so this compiles and returns 4. The fixture
; stays in the no-line-zero sweep as a compile-clean case, and the behaviour it
; used to fail with is pinned positively by examples/g0-forward-value.nuc.
(defn use-it ():i32
  (return gv))

(defvar gv:i32 4)

(defn main ():i32
  (return (use-it)))
